[FINAL-TEXT] I have all the evidence needed. The picture is complete:

- DNS (`named`) is healthy on `srv1` (10.5.0.4), wildcard `*.jeremysitlab.com → 10.5.0.4` resolves correctly from every client.
- Apache2 is installed on `srv1`, config passes `apache2ctl -t` (`Syntax OK`), and `/var/www/html/index.html` exists.
- **`ps aux` shows only PID 1 (bash) and `named` — no apache2 process at all.**
- `ss -tlnp` confirms nothing listens on port 80.
